WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
Can you look at my body?

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,200
I went to help someone carry a building yesterday

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,800
Moving down from the fifth floor is easy

4
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:07,900
Aren't you just moving things? I can do that.

5
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:10,000
I didn’t expect that I would have two buns

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
I actually found someone to move my things for me at a low price.

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,100
I'm better off selling out

8
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,000
Go home after closing time

9
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,700
Move things immediately, brother

10
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:19,000
You have a really good body

11
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Take my tricycle

12
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,720
I'll take you back, brother

13
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:24,520
We are not locals

14
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:26,320
He came from other places to work.

15
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,920
We saved a lot of money with our own hands

16
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,420
Bought a house

17
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:31,320
The house is now renovated

18
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:33,220
Going to move to a new house

19
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:36,410
I won’t rent a house in Chengzun Village anymore.

20
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:38,310
It's like a life of being frozen and subdued

21
00:00:38,310 --> 00:00:40,410
It's not as easy as I imagined

22
00:00:40,410 --> 00:00:43,450
Aren't they cows and horses? Let's go

23
00:00:43,450 --> 00:00:47,970
Let's go up and move things.

24
00:00:47,970 --> 00:00:48,970
Be faster

25
00:00:48,970 --> 00:00:50,970
The freight company's car will arrive soon

26
00:00:50,970 --> 00:00:52,570
Those people have bad tempers

27
00:00:52,570 --> 00:00:54,370
If you let them wait below for a while,

28
00:00:54,370 --> 00:00:59,320
They're circling over there again. It's okay. I'll come.

29
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:00,620
Let’s move the electrical appliances down first.
